  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ウラジロエノキ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A6%E3%83%A9%E3%82%B8%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A8%E3%83%8E%E3%82%AD",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 109595252,
      "text": "ウラジロエノキ は、アサ科（ニレ科）の樹木。エノキにはさほど似ていない。成長が早く、アジアの熱帯域におけるパイオニア植物の一つ。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Trema orientale",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trema_orientale",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1338248363,
      "text": "Trema orientale is a species of flowering tree in the hemp family, Cannabaceae. It is known by many common names, including charcoal-tree, Indian charcoal-tree, pigeon wood, Oriental trema, and in Hawaii, where it has become naturalized, gunpowder tree, or nalita. It has a near universal distribution in tropical and warm temperate parts of the Old World, with a range extending from South Africa, through the Middle East, the Indian subcontinent and southern China to Southeast Asia and Australia."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Trema orientalis",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trema_orientalis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 215732609,
      "text": "Trema orientalis est une espèce de plantes à fleurs la famille des Ulmaceae ou des Celtidaceae, selon la classification classique, ou à celle des Cannabaceae, selon la classification phylogénétique."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Mengkirai",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mengkirai",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 29853963,
      "text": "Mengkirai, atau mengkurai adalah spesies tumbuhan berbunga dari keluarga rami, Cannabaceae. Di pelbagai daerah, ia juga memiliki nama lain, seperti; anggrung (Jw.); kuray (Sd.); angghrung (Mdr.); lenggung (Bl.) bengkire (Ach.); bongkoreyon mangkirai (Mng.) kemirei (Mly.); kutu, dehong, ngawoi, kawaemogane, bono, wulaya ; mumusut (Ambon); rufu (Trnt.) luwi (Tdr.)."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "uses": {
      "ja": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ウラジロエノキ § 利用",
        "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A6%E3%83%A9%E3%82%B8%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A8%E3%83%8E%E3%82%AD#%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 109595252,
        "heading": "利用",
        "text": "材は柔らかくて器具や建材に使われる。成長が早くて10-20年で利用でき、下駄材としてはキリに次ぐ。樹皮からはタンニンが取れるほか、その繊維から紙が作られる。\n成長が早いことから護岸用に植栽されることもある。\nケニア南部のキクユ人も家の柱、特に垂木として、また燃料として用いたり、根を咳止めの目的で噛んだりしていた。ニエリ県においてもやはり根の煎じ汁を喘息に対して用いるとの報告がある。",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Trema orientale § Medicinal use",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trema_orientale#Medicinal_use",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1338248363,
        "heading": "Medicinal use",
        "text": "The tree has various uses as an herbal medicine in a wide range of cultures. The leaves and the bark are used to treat coughs, sore throats, asthma, bronchitis, gonorrhea, yellow fever, toothache, and as an antidote to general poisoning. A bark infusion is reportedly drunk to control dysentery and a leaf decoction is used to deworm dogs. In recent pharmacological studies, an aqueous extract from the bark has been shown to reduce blood sugar levels in an experimental animal model of diabetes mellitus, and may be useful for treating this disease. Extracts from leaves of related species (Trema guineense and Trema micrantha) showed anti-inflammatory, anti-arthritic and analgesic activity in rodents, suggesting that T. orientale could produce similar results.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "id": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (id): Mengkirai § Khasiat",
        "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mengkirai#Khasiat",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 29853963,
        "heading": "Khasiat",
        "text": "Mengkirai memiliki berbagai khasiat sebagai obat herbal dalam berbagai budaya. Daun dan pepagannya digunakan untuk mengobati batuk, sakit tenggorokan, asma, bronkitis, kencing nanah, demam kuning, sakit gigi, dan sebagai penawar keracunan umum. Rendaman kulit batang dilaporkan diminum untuk mengendalikan disentri dan rebusan daunnya digunakan untuk menyembuhkan anjing cacingan.\nDalam studi farmakologis baru-baru ini, ekstrak air dari kulit batang telah terbukti mengurangi kadar gula darah dalam model hewan percobaan diabetes mellitus, dan mungkin berguna untuk mengobati penyakit ini. Ekstrak dari daun spesies terkait (T. guineense dan T. micrantha) menunjukkan aktivitas anti-inflamasi, anti-rematik dan analgesik pada hewan pengerat, dengan kemungkinan bahwa T. orientalis dapat menghasilkan hal yang serupa.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
